  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The equilibrium composition for the reaction&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>PCl</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>Cl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><munder><mo>&#8652;</mo><mrow></mrow></munder><msub><mi>PCl</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>298</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math>&nbsp;is given below:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi>PCl</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mi>eq</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi>Cl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mi>eq</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi>PCl</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></mfenced><mi>eq</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi></math> of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Cl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> is added at the same temperature, the equilibrium concentrations of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>PCl</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></math> is _____&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></msub></math> for the reaction at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>298</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "49",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mrow><msub><mi>PCl</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><mrow><msub><mi>Cl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munder><munder><mo>&#8652;</mo><mrow></mrow></munder><munder><mrow><msub><mi>PCl</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></munder></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></math></p><p>If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></math> moles of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Cl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> is added. When reactant is added the reaction takes place in forward direction.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>06</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>121</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>64</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>40</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>55</mn></mrow><mn>40</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8771;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>08625</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><msub><mi>PCl</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>48625</mn><mo>&#8771;</mo><mn>48</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>625</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>49</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p></blockquote>",
